<section class="wrap sec--day rule-top stack">
  <h2 class="h2 display">You are not at the terminal.</h2>
  <div class="prose">
    <p class="lede">
      You run five agents in Herdr. Four are grazing: heads down, working. One is stood at
      the fence, bleating. It needs a yes. You are at lunch, or on the bus, or in the other
      room.
    </p>
    <p class="lede">
      A <span class="np">गोठालो</span> [gothalo, herder] does not stare at every animal all
      day. The herd grazes. The herder listens for the one that calls, and walks down only
      when it matters.
    </p>
    <p class="lede">
      Herdr already tells the herd apart. Every agent, whichever vendor, is idle, working,
      blocked, or done. gothalo puts that on your phone and makes the blocked one ring.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
